<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,245,240)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="34" width="864" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>第五步 · 批判：换一条假设，结论就变</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="100" width="420" height="76"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>1883 年，伯特兰在书评里提出：厂商明明是在定价格，不是定产量。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="184" width="420" height="104"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>如果两家定价格、产品又完全相同——只要我的价格略高于成本，对手稍降一点就能抢走全部生意。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="296" width="420" height="76"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>结果：价格直接跌到成本，两家利润为零。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="372" width="420" height="76"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>只有两家卖者，却得到了完全竞争的结果。这就是“伯特兰悖论”。</p></content></shape><line startX="496" startY="104" endX="496" endY="430"><border color="rgb(214,200,194)" width="2"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="100" width="392" height="70"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>批评没有推翻古诺，而是指出：</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="166" width="392" height="56"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>此后每一种新模型，几乎都是改掉古诺的某一条假设。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="236" width="392" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>霍特林（1929）</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="266" width="392" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(160,110,105)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>产品有位置差异 → 改“同质”</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="304" width="392" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>斯塔克尔伯格（1934）</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="334" width="392" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(160,110,105)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>一先一后决策 → 改“同时”</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="372" width="392" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>张伯伦（1933）</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="402" width="392" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(160,110,105)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>卖者意识到相互依赖 → 改“对手产量给定”</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="462" width="864" height="40"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>知识创造的要点：一条反例，就是一个新模型的入口。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="14"><p><!-- citation: [5][6] --></p><p>伯特兰的批评只有一句话：厂商选的是价格，不是产量。</p><p>按价格竞争重新推一遍，结论变成价格等于成本、利润为零，这被称为伯特兰悖论。</p><p>这里的教训是：批评没有杀死古诺模型，而是揭示了结论依赖哪一条假设；之后几十年的寡头理论，基本都是在改古诺的假设。</p></content></note></slide>